      "content": "i understand but the er is so expensive and i really dont want to deal with the wait if it's just a minor nerve thing. look, i'm basically fine otherwise. no headache, no weakness in my hands, no blurry vision... it really does feel very isolated to just my face. are you sure i can't just wait and see if it improves by tomorrow morning? if it's just bell's palsy, it's not like it's going to get worse in the next few hours, right?",
